{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/11635","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"11635","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"PS3515.A795 A7 1921","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"Adventures in the arts: informal chapters on painters, vaudeville and poets ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Marsden Hartley","id":"actor/hartley-marsden","type":"Actor"},{"_label":"Boni \u0026 Liveright","id":"actor/boni-and-liveright","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"_label":"1921","begin_of_the_begin":"1921-01-01T00:00:00Z","end_of_the_end":"1921-01-01T00:00:00Z","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Ephemera : book originally housed in brown box with annotations by Alfred Stieglitz.\nEphemera found inside box : Handwritten note by Alfred Stieglitz : Inscribed by Hartley / for O'Keeffe / on page of Dedication / Important AS.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nSome of the papers included in this book have appeared in Art and archeology, the Seven arts, the Dial, the Nation, the New republic, and the Touchstone.-p. [vi].","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq copy : fair condition : some pages uncut ; dust jacket : good condition.|SColl abq : Annotation by [Alfred Stieglitz] : April 14 - 1924 / 60 E. 65 St.|SColl abq : Inscription from Marsden Hartley to [Georgia] O'Keeffe, undated : My dear O'Keefe [sic] - / That you have ridden way / beyond the references in these / pages is your own perfect / discovery. I hope I may be able / to copy certain of your characteristics / in my own work, or at least / produce a similar precision of / causation. You know you have / in me one of your [rarest] / admirers. I know of nothing like / you in modern fields of / expression. It is no small thing to / stand for oneself. You do it. / Cordially Marsden Hartley.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/814401/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/814401"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"},{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/814412/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/814412"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"},{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/814417/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/814417"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io